{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_975.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"ee352cc2441c9aa11d3899659c746603163e03b1a25e6c12d24d85a5fc268195","ja":"みんなとPV撮影","zh":"和大家一起拍摄PV","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_975.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"dcaa8e2c76676235893091021e2c536d50645f19416b20cfd3ee500b17a49b8f","ja":"みんな、聞いた～？　今度のPV撮影！\nカーニバルみたいだよネ！","zh":"大家听说了吗～？下次要拍PV哦！\n好像嘉年华一样呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_975.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"41f13b98948a36125e836d6b174b841eab339dd3243a1da307500889f17c8de3","ja":"はい。街の中で、いろんな人と一緒に歌って踊る\n……今からドキドキです。","zh":"好的。要在街上和各种各样的人一起唱歌跳舞……\n光是现在就已经心跳加速了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_975.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"18f3f577dd30007248ff74ae00cdefbe2bc47cc33c2b58d981bbd18e73378fab","ja":"瑞希の気持ち、ボクもわかるよ～。プロの\nダンサーさん30人くらいに来てもらうんだっけ？","zh":"我也明白瑞希的心情哦～。是要请大约30位专业舞者来，对吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_975.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"2cbb86b7e8d493dac511e5b7310b7e978f7aa2b497c8ce352b343fd99057ce6c","ja":"ええ。そしてさらに、ファンの方々からも\nエキストラを募集しているとか。","zh":"是的。而且听说还在粉丝中招募临时演员。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_975.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"49bb9275ce85c33a5bc1c006e2290729b122ba5247fd4ed8a8f8d133271fc6cd","ja":"踊りが苦手な方も参加しやすいよう\nハンドベルも用意してくださるそうですわよ。","zh":"据说还准备了手铃，方便不擅长跳舞的人参加。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_975.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4639117648aedbb3d59d37b7f7746cf6a2a10eec07733a87f463c5ceca030d33","ja":"それなら、たくさんの人に参加してもらえそうですね！\nへへっ、なんだか今からワクワクしてきました♪","zh":"这样的话，应该能让很多人参加进来吧！\n嘿嘿，不知怎么的，现在就开始期待起来了♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_975.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"564eac4930d7b2446f089fb1e78c35cfcf7136f0ca58cd52f7fc34c08d5aa5b2","ja":"ええ！　わたくしたちも、\nしっかり準備しておかないといけませんわね！","zh":"没错！我们也得做好充分准备才行呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_975.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"ae3c79944a0baedd281474e08d37effcbb32a3e4715c7b025eabb730d692def3","ja":"はい。私たちが中心になるわけですから、\nしっかり盛り上げないと……責任重大だぞ。","zh":"是。毕竟我们会成为核心，不好好炒热气氛可不行……责任重大啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_975.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"147e7ba161546ff0358d38abfa7daf3e6f7ff4a00dec8b1601a549d8ab980423","ja":"ワタシたちなら、ゼッタイ大丈夫だヨ♪\n子どもたちとのステージも成功させたんだし！","zh":"我们的话，绝对没问题哦♪\n和孩子们一起的舞台也成功完成了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_975.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"da0ad2acc1762cb69cfa47ce3e2d2bf4aca47f8cee4c473f2b524fecf43082ef","ja":"はやくたくさんの人と歌って踊りたいナ♪\n冬でもあったかいPV撮影にしようネっ！","zh":"真想快点和很多人一起唱歌跳舞呀♪\n即使是冬天，也要拍摄一支暖洋洋的PV哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
